  "published": "2026-09-13T00:47:12.847Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LICENSE CHANGE: releases after v1.2.0 are distributed under the ZArchiveSharp Non-Commercial License (see LICENSE) to comply with the ZarManager 1.2.0 license; commercial use and selling are prohibited. The v1.2.0 packages were published under MIT. v1.2.0 features: opt-out CLI telemetry, logging, bug reports and update checks; extraction hardening (zip-slip/device-name rejection, bounded nesting, scratch-and-move writes, no symlink traversal); strict CLI argument rules (-- terminator everywhere, dashed values, unknown-option errors, batch exit -11/-13); decoder total-output cap; seekable range errors are ArgumentOutOfRangeException; CP1252 name identity and other correctness fixes. See WhatsNew.md.",
